Vale Voices
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The rules under Moose/styles/Voices/ and Moose/styles/Direct/ are copied from
Vale Voices (https://github.com/jdkato/voices), Copyright (c) 2026 Joseph Kato
and contributors, licensed under the MIT License. They were taken from commit
511491f9d65c (2026-09-03). Moose changes, each marked in the rule file:

  Voices/BinaryContrast.yml  bounded clause allows punctuation, never a newline
  Voices/ColonReveal.yml     horizontal whitespace only, no cross-line matches
  Voices/InflatedWords.yml   capitalize: true so auto-fixes keep the case
  Voices/WeakVerbs.yml       one replacement per inflection, always grammatical

